{"2469260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Parkour Labs", "steam_appid": 2469260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3007780, 4508640], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469260/extras/aaa11e4624b24a0085efd14451b0ec96.avif?t=1786473264\" width=552 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469260/extras/c21dcb92d8d4243818e2a7104f2bc86b.poster.avif?t=1786473264\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469260/extras/c21dcb92d8d4243818e2a7104f2bc86b.webm?t=1786473264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469260/extras/c21dcb92d8d4243818e2a7104f2bc86b.mp4?t=1786473264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parkour Labs returns with a major upgrade — now playable in VR.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master speed, flow and precision in a stylized parkour experience built around movement freedom. Run, surf and chain momentum across surreal vaporwave environments designed to test both skill and immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step Inside the Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience parkour like never before — play traditionally on screen or step inside the movement with full VR support. Every jump, slide and turn is designed around fluid motion and player control, rewarding mastery and flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Loop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore colorful surreal landscapes inspired by vaporwave aesthetics while chaining movement techniques, discovering shortcuts and unlocking new challenges. Precision and rhythm are key as you push your skills further with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Vibes, Modern Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a nostalgic world inspired by 80s and 90s visual culture, synthwave music and glitch aesthetics, blending retro atmosphere with modern movement gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* <strong>Full VR Mode</strong> — experience parkour in immersive first-person</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* <strong>Fluid movement</strong> system focused on speed and flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Stylized vaporwave worlds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Skill-based gameplay rewarding mastery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Unlock secrets, levels and movement routes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Designed for both VR and traditional play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR Compatibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Playable in Virtual Reality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Motion controller support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Designed for immersive movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469260/extras/18feb155a3298e0f3b0fcbc12cc677bd.avif?t=1786473264\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469260/extras/aaa11e4624b24a0085efd14451b0ec96.avif?t=1786473264\" width=552 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469260/extras/c21dcb92d8d4243818e2a7104f2bc86b.poster.avif?t=1786473264\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469260/extras/c21dcb92d8d4243818e2a7104f2bc86b.webm?t=1786473264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469260/extras/c21dcb92d8d4243818e2a7104f2bc86b.mp4?t=1786473264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parkour Labs returns with a major upgrade — now playable in VR.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master speed, flow and precision in a stylized parkour experience built around movement freedom. Run, surf and chain momentum across surreal vaporwave environments designed to test both skill and immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step Inside the Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience parkour like never before — play traditionally on screen or step inside the movement with full VR support. Every jump, slide and turn is designed around fluid motion and player control, rewarding mastery and flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Loop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore colorful surreal landscapes inspired by vaporwave aesthetics while chaining movement techniques, discovering shortcuts and unlocking new challenges. Precision and rhythm are key as you push your skills further with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Vibes, Modern Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a nostalgic world inspired by 80s and 90s visual culture, synthwave music and glitch aesthetics, blending retro atmosphere with modern movement gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* <strong>Full VR Mode</strong> — experience parkour in immersive first-person</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* <strong>Fluid movement</strong> system focused on speed and flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Stylized vaporwave worlds</p><p cla